  "story": {
    "day": 164,
    "title": "Kaya's Rainy Day Dreams",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a rainy afternoon.",
      "Kaya spent forty minutes at her desk.",
      "She thought about public school.",
      "Her little brother, age six, held her arm and put his head on her shoulder.",
      "\"Will we climb that rope?\" he asked.",
      "Kaya gave a quick answer and laughed. His face needed attention.",
      "\"I'll boil water for spaghetti or curry,\" she said.",
      "She would add one tablespoon of sauce with one ounce of cabbage.",
      "Or maybe steak with fresh lettuce.",
      "For dessert, such good pudding at 7 p.m.",
      "\"You'll think it's a million stars!\" He'll take off his plate.",
      "Kaya looked forward to skiing the day after tomorrow."
    ]
  }
